# Datasets and released checkpoints. Everything under data/ is fetched, not authored:
# Gen1 and DSEC as distributed, and the RVT and SSM-ViT checkpoints. 35 GB, and the
# provenance for re-fetching it is in experiments/e47_ssm/PROVENANCE.md and data/dsec/fetch.sh.
data/

# Rendered PNG sequences for the video. 124 MB, and every one of them is reproducible from
# src/v0*.py plus the experiment artifacts that are tracked. The encoded clips are kept.
video/frames/

